ur light. \n\nThe sunlight streams through towering, intricately carved marble arches, casting long, dramatic shadows that frame her figure like a work of art. Each droplet of water on her radiant skin catches the light, sparkling like tiny diamonds, while her damp, wavy, jet-black hair cascades down her back in perfect, flowing waves. \n\nShe turns back gracefully, her movements as fluid as a dance, and a gentle, knowing smile blooms at the corner of her lips, exuding both mystery and warmth. Her almond-shaped eyes glimmer with a luminous depth, inviting the viewer into her serene, dreamlike world. The scene is hyper-realistic, as if captured by the lens of a master photographer, with every detail meticulously crafted. \n\nCinematic visuals and dramatic lighting amplify the goddess’s divine aura, while the ethereal atmosphere imbues the composition with a sense of otherworldly tranquility. A perfect blend of artistry and realism, this breathtaking moment feels like a glimpse into a mythological tale, destined to trend on ArtStation and captivate imaginations around the world.\n\n--- \n\nLet me know if you'd like me to refine or adjust it further!"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 163, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 124, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [173], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [315, 106], "pos": [435, 2230], "widgets_values": ["####", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "string", "link": 170, "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}, {"widget": {"name": "old"}, "name": "old", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "旧"}, {"widget": {"name": "new"}, "name": "new", "link": 177, "label": "new", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "新"}], "flags": {}, "id": 127, "type": "String Replace (mtb)", "pro